48
00:01:51,040 --> 00:01:52,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In any case,
all we can do is search for him.</font>

49
00:01:53,460 --> 00:01:57,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it. Where's Iruka-sensei?!</font>

50
00:02:05,980 --> 00:02:07,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka-sensei!</font>

51
00:02:08,770 --> 00:02:10,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a relief!</font>

52
00:02:10,150 --> 00:02:11,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're safe!</font>

53
00:02:12,900 --> 00:02:13,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Somehow...</font>

54
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:18,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn... that Mizuki...</font>

55
00:02:19,950 --> 00:02:20,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka-sensei...</font>

56
00:02:21,450 --> 00:02:22,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That injury...</font>

57
00:02:22,990 --> 00:02:25,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh, this injury is nothing...</font>

58
00:02:27,830 --> 00:02:28,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka-sensei!</font>

59
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:32,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm all right...
I just had a little rush of pain...</font>

60
00:02:34,210 --> 00:02:35,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Somebody's approaching!</font>

61
00:02:44,930 --> 00:02:46,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a relief
the wound's not deep.</font>

62
00:02:47,890 --> 00:02:48,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes...</font>

63
00:02:50,900 --> 00:02:53,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The atmosphere feels kind of heavy...</font>

64
00:02:53,650 --> 00:02:57,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm... There must be something
between those two...</font>

65
00:02:57,900 --> 00:02:59,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, what I think is...</font>

66
00:03:01,910 --> 00:03:03,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's up with the paw pad?</font>

67
00:03:03,870 --> 00:03:06,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot! Look carefully!
The little finger, the little finger!</font>

68
00:03:06,910 --> 00:03:10,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Little finger? Huh?!
Iruka-sensei's?</font>

69
00:03:11,460 --> 00:03:14,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, my intuition tells me
that it's positive...</font>

70
00:03:14,420 --> 00:03:16,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, what are you two
talking about?</font>

71
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:19,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh, nothing!</font>

72
00:03:20,720 --> 00:03:22,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Let me make an introduction.</font>

73
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:26,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is Tsubaki...
Mizuki's fiancée.</font>

74
00:03:27,850 --> 00:03:29,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fiancée? Mizuki's...?</font>

75
00:03:29,890 --> 00:03:31,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ah, it's negative...</font>

76
00:03:31,850 --> 00:03:32,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's up with that reaction?!</font>

77
00:03:33,860 --> 00:03:36,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki has caused problems
for you again...</font>

78
00:03:37,610 --> 00:03:39,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I sincerely apologize for that.</font>

79
00:03:40,610 --> 00:03:44,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you know about
Mizuki's prison break...?</font>

80
00:03:47,450 --> 00:03:48,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes...</font>

81
00:03:49,200 --> 00:03:51,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He came by my house once...</font>

82
00:03:53,790 --> 00:03:56,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I became aware of that immediately
and tried to stop him.</font>

83
00:03:57,800 --> 00:04:00,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But ultimately the result
was that I allowed him to go...</font>

84
00:04:02,930 --> 00:04:06,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It really couldn't be helped
in light of the situation...</font>

85
00:04:07,050 --> 00:04:10,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No. I should have tried
even harder to stop him.</font>

86
00:04:12,230 --> 00:04:13,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I...</font>

87
00:04:26,820 --> 00:04:29,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka, Naruto, I beg you!</font>

88
00:04:30,750 --> 00:04:33,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please take me with you!</font>

89
00:04:34,870 --> 00:04:35,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsubaki...</font>

90
00:04:36,830 --> 00:04:39,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand that I'm making
an impossible request!</font>

91
00:04:40,380 --> 00:04:43,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I want to stop him,
no matter what!</font>

92
00:04:44,930 --> 00:04:45,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka-sensei!</font>

93
00:04:46,890 --> 00:04:50,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsubaki, I understand how you feel.</font>

94
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:52,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that case...</font>

95
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:56,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry, but I cannot allow that.</font>

96
00:04:58,230 --> 00:04:59,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But why...?</font>

97
00:05:01,280 --> 00:05:02,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why can't she?!</font>

98
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:07,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, we must hurry up
and search for Mizuki!</font>

99
00:05:07,950 --> 00:05:11,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If she's with us,
she'll interfere with our mission!</font>

100
00:05:11,830 --> 00:05:13,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... But...!</font>

101
00:05:14,250 --> 00:05:18,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka... If that's the case,
I think I'll be of service to you.</font>

102
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:23,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have an idea of
where he might be heading!</font>

103
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:26,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that true, Tsubaki?!</font>

104
00:05:27,390 --> 00:05:29,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's probably no mistake...</font>

105
00:05:30,890 --> 00:05:31,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

106
00:05:31,890 --> 00:05:33,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I beg you!</font>

107
00:05:33,810 --> 00:05:35,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think it's certain</font>

108
00:05:35,270 --> 00:05:38,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that he'll use various tricks to camouflage
his tracks as he flees...</font>

109
00:05:39,770 --> 00:05:42,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we spend time on that...
it will all be too late!</font>

110
00:05:45,700 --> 00:05:48,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please take me with you!</font>

111
00:06:08,720 --> 00:06:11,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Regarding the matter of Nara No. 23...</font>

112
00:06:11,850 --> 00:06:13,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh, what was the result?</font>

113
00:06:13,850 --> 00:06:15,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Ninja Herb: Creeping Saxifrage...</font>

114
00:06:15,850 --> 00:06:17,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?! Who are you!</font>

115
00:06:24,780 --> 00:06:26,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dragon, Rooster, Dog...</font>

116
00:06:45,130 --> 00:06:46,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The lookouts have been taken down!</font>

117
00:06:47,090 --> 00:06:48,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's an intruder!</font>

118
00:06:57,020 --> 00:06:58,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

119
00:06:58,230 --> 00:07:00,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Nara Clan's research lab
was attacked?!</font>

120
00:07:02,520 --> 00:07:05,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes... I just received a dispatch
from the Nara Clan...</font>

121
00:07:06,820 --> 00:07:08,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">According to the dispatch,</font>

122
00:07:08,110 --> 00:07:10,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the insurgent's physical characteristics
match those of Mizuki.</font>

123
00:07:11,530 --> 00:07:12,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki's...?</font>

124
00:07:12,870 --> 00:07:13,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes!</font>

125
00:07:15,080 --> 00:07:17,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is that Naruto doing?</font>

126
00:07:18,910 --> 00:07:22,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it's something to have come up
with the idea of the Nara Clan's institute...</font>

127
00:07:22,710 --> 00:07:25,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Notwithstanding the abundance of
narcotic substances that are stored there,</font>

128
00:07:25,880 --> 00:07:28,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">due to its remote mountain location,
security is comparatively lax.</font>

129
00:07:29,670 --> 00:07:31,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And what substances were stolen?</font>

130
00:07:31,930 --> 00:07:35,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... Because of their thorough control
of the substances,</font>

131
00:07:35,390 --> 00:07:39,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they were able to determine immediately
which substances were taken...</font>

132
00:07:43,520 --> 00:07:44,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So the description matched
after all, huh...</font>

133
00:07:45,940 --> 00:07:50,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But even if a mere Chunin were
to remove those narcotic substances</font>

134
00:07:50,150 --> 00:07:51,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">what would he be able
to do with them?</font>

135
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:57,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... Thank you. You may go now...</font>

136
00:07:57,700 --> 00:07:58,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes ma'am!</font>

137
00:08:04,170 --> 00:08:07,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In any case,
I can't take any chances...</font>

138
00:08:07,710 --> 00:08:10,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's nothing I can do if
I don't know what his objective is.</font>

139
00:08:11,840 --> 00:08:13,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I can't discern that from
the actual materials...</font>

140
00:08:13,970 --> 00:08:16,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there may still be some means...</font>

141
00:08:17,560 --> 00:08:19,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perhaps the proportions
of the formula,</font>

142
00:08:19,220 --> 00:08:21,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">or possibly the order
in which they're blended...</font>

143
00:08:26,310 --> 00:08:28,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no mistake that
it's this direction, right?</font>

144
00:08:28,860 --> 00:08:31,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes... Please continue to
proceed just like this.</font>

145
00:08:32,490 --> 00:08:36,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsubaki, you said
"It will all be too late."</font>

146
00:08:36,660 --> 00:08:38,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But do you know what
his objective is?</font>

147
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:42,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Probably... Although maybe not totally.</font>

148
00:08:43,040 --> 00:08:45,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsubaki, please tell us!</font>

149
00:08:47,210 --> 00:08:49,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the past, he told me...</font>

150
00:08:49,800 --> 00:08:54,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"I will get my hands on Orochimaru's power
and go to where Orochimaru is."</font>

151
00:08:55,180 --> 00:08:56,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was that?!</font>

152
00:08:59,390 --> 00:09:01,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The reason he stole
the Scroll of Sealing</font>

153
00:09:02,020 --> 00:09:06,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was simply because
he had chosen it as a hospitality gift...</font>

154
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:11,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsubaki... You knew that?</font>

155
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:14,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't convey it to the village...</font>

156
00:09:14,320 --> 00:09:18,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just removing the Scroll of Sealing
is a serious felony...</font>

157
00:09:18,780 --> 00:09:21,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And moreover, I was scared for
what'd happen</font>

158
00:09:21,620 --> 00:09:23,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if his real objective
had come to light...</font>

159
00:09:24,790 --> 00:09:27,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I believed that he would
mend his ways.</font>

160
00:09:28,420 --> 00:09:31,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that case you cannot avoid
retribution either.</font>

161
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am prepared for it.</font>

162
00:09:33,880 --> 00:09:36,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought it was strange...</font>

163
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:38,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you knew where Mizuki was going,</font>

164
00:09:38,640 --> 00:09:41,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you should have pursued him alone
in the first place.</font>

165
00:09:42,560 --> 00:09:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you...</font>

166
00:09:45,770 --> 00:09:49,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I may not be able to stop him alone...</font>

167
00:09:51,480 --> 00:09:54,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to stop him at any cost...</font>

168
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:56,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't want him to commit
any more crimes.</font>

169
00:09:58,860 --> 00:09:59,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unbelievable!</font>

170
00:10:00,620 --> 00:10:03,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Orochimaru...
So this was his plan!</font>

171
00:10:06,710 --> 00:10:10,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, could an ordinary Ninja
really manage to do this...?</font>

172
00:10:10,080 --> 00:10:11,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's something only within</font>

173
00:10:11,590 --> 00:10:13,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the realm of an experienced
artisan's technique...</font>

174
00:10:15,920 --> 00:10:17,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm busy!</font>

175
00:10:17,680 --> 00:10:19,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have a progress report on
the inmate prison break incident!</font>

176
00:10:23,850 --> 00:10:25,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right... Enter!</font>

177
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:26,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, ma'am!</font>

178
00:10:30,560 --> 00:10:32,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have just finished
recapturing all inmates</font>

179
00:10:32,230 --> 00:10:37,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with the exception of three —
Mizuki, Fujin and Raijin.</font>

180
00:10:38,150 --> 00:10:38,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good work...</font>

181
00:10:39,610 --> 00:10:42,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We are now continuing to investigate
the other three...</font>

182
00:10:43,030 --> 00:10:49,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, the last inmate we captured said
something that concerned me...</font>

183
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:53,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something that concerned you?</font>

184
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:58,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes... He apparently saw the three of
them fleeing together...</font>

185
00:10:59,590 --> 00:11:01,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fujin and Raijin were fleeing
with Mizuki?!</font>

186
00:11:03,100 --> 00:11:03,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

187
00:11:06,850 --> 00:11:08,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama...?</font>

188
00:11:08,730 --> 00:11:09,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going out!</font>

189
00:11:09,810 --> 00:11:10,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where are you going?</font>

190
00:11:11,310 --> 00:11:12,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no need for you to come...</font>

191
00:11:13,560 --> 00:11:16,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If what he said is true,</font>

192
00:11:16,230 --> 00:11:20,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the guys I sent out won't be able
to deal with the situation alone...</font>

193
00:11:31,500 --> 00:11:34,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Shikamaru...
If things continue like this...</font>

194
00:11:35,500 --> 00:11:37,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we'll be in trouble!</font>

195
00:11:37,920 --> 00:11:40,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're already in trouble...</font>

196
00:11:40,630 --> 00:11:43,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru... All the Chakra is...</font>

197
00:11:44,140 --> 00:11:45,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know that...</font>

198
00:11:46,220 --> 00:11:49,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've thought of several methods,</font>

199
00:11:50,730 --> 00:11:54,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but if I let go of these guys we are
gonna find ourselves in trouble...</font>

200
00:11:54,770 --> 00:11:56,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You insolent jerk!</font>

201
00:11:56,610 --> 00:11:57,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Having said that,</font>

202
00:11:57,820 --> 00:11:59,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't take them down simply
by catching them,</font>

203
00:11:59,740 --> 00:12:01,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so that's why I'm doing this...</font>

204
00:12:01,570 --> 00:12:03,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you leave here alive!</font>

205
00:12:04,200 --> 00:12:07,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These guys have monstrous stamina...</font>

206
00:12:07,740 --> 00:12:08,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And what's more,</font>

207
00:12:08,660 --> 00:12:10,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">although their bodies
look like rubber at first glance,</font>

208
00:12:10,870 --> 00:12:14,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with that much muscle strength
their instantaneous reflexes</font>

209
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:15,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">are probably quite something too...</font>

210
00:12:16,590 --> 00:12:17,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words,</font>

211
00:12:17,630 --> 00:12:20,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're saying that this is
the only possible method...</font>

212
00:12:20,710 --> 00:12:22,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's do our best, everyone!</font>

213
00:12:23,090 --> 00:12:24,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry about this...</font>

214
00:12:51,410 --> 00:12:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you think, Mizuki?</font>

215
00:12:55,500 --> 00:12:58,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no good...
It's unfortunate but, he can no longer...</font>

216
00:12:59,300 --> 00:13:03,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...
All right! Let's withdraw!</font>

217
00:13:04,300 --> 00:13:05,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up!</font>

218
00:13:05,220 --> 00:13:06,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

219
00:13:11,350 --> 00:13:12,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's unfortunate but...</font>

220
00:13:12,850 --> 00:13:14,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">guys who are of no use
on the battleground</font>

221
00:13:15,060 --> 00:13:16,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">only become a ball and chain...</font>

222
00:13:17,600 --> 00:13:19,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though it's just a minor injury,</font>

223
00:13:19,320 --> 00:13:21,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you won't be able to move
from this place, can you?</font>

224
00:13:27,320 --> 00:13:28,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who's that?!</font>

225
00:13:32,290 --> 00:13:35,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no! Is it Genjutsu Paralysis?!</font>

226
00:13:36,460 --> 00:13:38,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I saw that...</font>

227
00:13:41,920 --> 00:13:44,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way... This can't be, you're...</font>

228
00:13:44,720 --> 00:13:45,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru?!</font>

229
00:13:49,010 --> 00:13:50,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are correct...</font>

230
00:13:50,760 --> 00:13:53,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This can't be...
Why are you here?</font>

231
00:13:53,850 --> 00:13:55,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your whereabouts are supposed
to be unknown!</font>

232
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:58,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't matter why...</font>

233
00:13:59,520 --> 00:14:00,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More importantly,</font>

234
00:14:00,440 --> 00:14:03,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I witnessed something
very interesting earlier on...</font>

235
00:14:05,070 --> 00:14:07,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You took the life of
an injured comrade, didn't you?</font>

236
00:14:08,820 --> 00:14:09,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You saw that...?</font>

237
00:14:10,740 --> 00:14:12,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That piqued my interest...</font>

238
00:14:13,240 --> 00:14:16,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not a sight one sees
very often among the Leaf Shinobi</font>

239
00:14:16,460 --> 00:14:20,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who devote their entire time
to playing house in the village...</font>

240
00:14:20,380 --> 00:14:22,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what are you trying to say?!</font>

241
00:14:23,130 --> 00:14:27,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't do anything wrong!
I had no choice but to do what I did!</font>

242
00:14:28,010 --> 00:14:31,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a short-tempered child,
aren't you...?</font>

243
00:14:31,800 --> 00:14:37,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not reproaching you.
You were just carrying out your mission.</font>

244
00:14:38,980 --> 00:14:39,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...</font>

245
00:14:40,440 --> 00:14:47,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... Is there anybody in
the Leaf Village who acknowledges you?</font>

246
00:14:54,830 --> 00:14:55,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you just do?!</font>

247
00:14:59,290 --> 00:15:00,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What in the world is this...?</font>

248
00:15:02,920 --> 00:15:05,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is my present to you...</font>

249
00:15:11,390 --> 00:15:14,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go visit that place if you feel like it.</font>

250
00:16:00,810 --> 00:16:01,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here it is...</font>

251
00:16:25,580 --> 00:16:28,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks like there hasn't been
a trespasser here before me...</font>

252
00:16:35,050 --> 00:16:37,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The eighth one on the right...</font>

253
00:16:56,780 --> 00:16:57,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's happening?</font>

254
00:17:22,220 --> 00:17:25,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is that power of
Orochimaru's anyway?</font>

255
00:17:26,520 --> 00:17:28,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know either.</font>

256
00:17:28,810 --> 00:17:32,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I don't know when
he encountered Orochimaru either...</font>

257
00:17:33,150 --> 00:17:36,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I'm positive that the answer to
those questions is waiting just up ahead!</font>

258
00:17:39,070 --> 00:17:40,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Scroll of Sealing incident...</font>

259
00:17:41,160 --> 00:17:43,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You must be angry about it,
aren't you, Naruto?</font>

260
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:47,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't care about that in
the least anymore...</font>

261
00:17:47,540 --> 00:17:51,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because I repaid my debt to that
jerk Mizuki right there and then.</font>

262
00:17:51,960 --> 00:17:52,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

263
00:17:53,090 --> 00:17:54,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But?</font>

264
00:17:54,130 --> 00:17:57,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that guy is still connected
to Orochimaru,</font>

265
00:17:57,050 --> 00:17:59,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I need to ask him about something!</font>

266
00:18:00,050 --> 00:18:04,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because there's someone
I need to find at any cost!</font>

267
00:18:06,940 --> 00:18:08,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...!</font>

268
00:18:15,110 --> 00:18:16,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's up there...</font>

269
00:18:16,860 --> 00:18:18,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!</font>

270
00:18:38,340 --> 00:18:40,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's everything...</font>

271
00:18:58,900 --> 00:19:00,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With this all...</font>

272
00:19:03,030 --> 00:19:04,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This will...</font>

273
00:19:05,490 --> 00:19:07,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This will make me perfect!</font>

274
00:19:12,830 --> 00:19:13,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This place is...</font>

275
00:19:15,050 --> 00:19:17,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy has done something...</font>

276
00:19:18,050 --> 00:19:20,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That smell gives me the shivers...</font>

277
00:19:21,010 --> 00:19:22,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Smell?</font>

278
00:19:25,560 --> 00:19:27,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was wondering who that was...</font>

279
00:19:27,770 --> 00:19:30,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys are really persistent,
aren't you?</font>

280
00:19:31,480 --> 00:19:33,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, this is very convenient.</font>

281
00:19:33,270 --> 00:19:36,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because I was intending to take
you guys down anyway.</font>

282
00:19:37,150 --> 00:19:38,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki...</font>

283
00:19:38,900 --> 00:19:39,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You jerk!</font>

284
00:19:40,030 --> 00:19:43,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki... Your ambitions end here!</font>

285
00:19:44,120 --> 00:19:47,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Impudent as always, huh...
However, you're too late!</font>

286
00:19:48,040 --> 00:19:49,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just like you always are...</font>

287
00:19:50,210 --> 00:19:51,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is that?</font>

288
00:19:53,080 --> 00:19:55,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Beautiful, don't you think?</font>

289
00:19:59,130 --> 00:20:00,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

290
00:20:02,050 --> 00:20:08,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys... should feel honoured
to be my first prey...</font>

291
00:20:18,110 --> 00:20:18,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

292
00:20:20,860 --> 00:20:23,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's... almost like...</font>

293
00:20:23,990 --> 00:20:27,910
